From: =?UTF-8?q?Caol=C3=A1n=20McNamara?= <caolan.mcnamara@collabora.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:41:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] read textdb.allow_full_path only as a Java system property

HSQLDB 2.x reads it that way since 2.1.0, see svn r3769
https://github.com/ryenus/hsqldb/commit/909e46eb5aea11a38aad3d1f57f5a656eba8132e
---
 src/org/hsqldb/persist/Log.java | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/org/hsqldb/persist/Log.java b/src/org/hsqldb/persist/Log.java
index 284d9f4..18c698b 100644
--- a/src/org/hsqldb/persist/Log.java
+++ b/src/org/hsqldb/persist/Log.java
@@ -763,7 +763,7 @@ public class Log {
 
         closeTextCache(table);
 
-        if (!properties.isPropertyTrue(
+        if (!Boolean.getBoolean(
                 HsqlDatabaseProperties.textdb_allow_full_path)) {
             if (source.indexOf("..") != -1) {
                 throw (Trace.error(Trace.ACCESS_IS_DENIED, source));
-- 
2.55.0

